  "description": "WebRTC direct peer-to-peer transport for the Aether mesh protocol. Establishes NAT-traversed RTCDataChannel connections (via SIPSorcery, pure C#) between nodes, with SDP/ICE signalling carried over an existing relay transport. Implements ITransportService and sits between the radio mesh and the QUIC/HTTP relay in the transport ladder, so a direct internet path is preferred when one can be negotiated and the relay carries the rest.",
